      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should call the doctor but i can't get through to them right now and they don't call back for hours. i'm just miserable and i feel like i can't function. isn't a standard dose of ibuprofen like, just one pill? it's not like i'm taking a whole bottle. it feels way too risky to just sit here in pain when i know i have advil in the cabinet. won't one pill really do anything?",
